IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cta-community`
IMPORT `cta-qa`

-- Community Titles Act 2018 (WA) -- cases for the Q&A layer (cta-qa.l4): every exported question, for every role and
-- every situation.
--
-- Each question is asked for the roles it is not about, with every other input an ASSUMEd value that has none: the
-- answer must be `does not arise for you`, and reading any of those inputs would stop the evaluation with an error
-- ("it is an assumed term"). Each question that takes a situation input is asked, for its own roles, with each value
-- under which the situation does not hold and every later input ASSUMEd: again `does not arise for you`. Those cases
-- are generated from the exports' own parameter lists (the first section). For the owner and the buyer (the baseline's
-- seat) the answers are also asserted equal to the baseline export's own answer on the same facts. Expected values are
-- worked by hand from the deposited text, never copied from the output.
--
-- BASELINE. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `Cases -- the Q&A layer`

ASSUME `an unasked fact` IS A BOOLEAN
ASSUME `an unasked number` IS A NUMBER
ASSUME `an unasked tier` IS A `Tier`
ASSUME `an unasked kind of resolution` IS A `Kind of resolution`
ASSUME `an unasked by-law` IS A `What the by-law does`
ASSUME `an unasked dispute` IS A `My dispute`
ASSUME `an unasked change` IS A `What changed before settlement`
ASSUME `an unasked variation` IS A `Notifiable variation`

`as the owner` MEANS `I own a lot in a community titles scheme`
`as the buyer` MEANS `I am buying a lot in a community titles scheme`
`as the seller` MEANS `I am selling a lot in a community titles scheme`
`as the occupier` MEANS `I occupy or lease a lot in a community titles scheme, but do not own it`

`a quiet-hours by-law` MEANS `What the by-law does` WITH
    `is beyond any power to make it` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the Act or another written law` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the community development statement` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with a restricted use condition` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the by-laws of a higher-tier scheme` IS FALSE
    `limits a member's vote beyond barring arrears on ordinary resolutions` IS FALSE
    `restricts selling, leasing, mortgaging or passing on a lot` IS FALSE
    `discharges or modifies an easement or restrictive covenant` IS FALSE
    `restricts an assistance animal of a person with a disability` IS FALSE
    `is unfairly prejudicial, discriminatory, oppressive or unreasonable, as the Tribunal finds` IS FALSE

`a by-law against assistance dogs` MEANS `What the by-law does` WITH
    `is beyond any power to make it` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the Act or another written law` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the community development statement` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with a restricted use condition` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the by-laws of a higher-tier scheme` IS FALSE
    `limits a member's vote beyond barring arrears on ordinary resolutions` IS FALSE
    `restricts selling, leasing, mortgaging or passing on a lot` IS FALSE
    `discharges or modifies an easement or restrictive covenant` IS FALSE
    `restricts an assistance animal of a person with a disability` IS TRUE
    `is unfairly prejudicial, discriminatory, oppressive or unreasonable, as the Tribunal finds` IS FALSE

-- The unit entitlement of an 80/1000 lot is now 85/1000: up 6.25% of the notified proportion, type 1 (s 3(1)(b)).
`the townhouse's estimated unit entitlement grows` MEANS `What changed before settlement` WITH
    `the notified area of the lot` IS 220
    `the area of the lot now` IS 220
    `the notified unit entitlement` IS 80
    `the notified sum of unit entitlements` IS 1000
    `the unit entitlement now` IS 85
    `the sum of unit entitlements now` IS 1000
    `termination papers were served on the seller` IS FALSE
    `the community development statement was modified` IS FALSE
    `the scheme plan was modified affecting the lot or common property` IS FALSE
    `the by-laws were modified` IS FALSE
    `a services contract was entered or varied` IS FALSE
    `a lease or licence over common property was granted or varied` IS FALSE

-- Only the by-laws were changed: type 2 (s 3(1), "type 2 notifiable variation").
`the by-laws are changed` MEANS `What changed before settlement` WITH
    `the notified area of the lot` IS 220
    `the area of the lot now` IS 220
    `the notified unit entitlement` IS 80
    `the notified sum of unit entitlements` IS 1000
    `the unit entitlement now` IS 80
    `the sum of unit entitlements now` IS 1000
    `termination papers were served on the seller` IS FALSE
    `the community development statement was modified` IS FALSE
    `the scheme plan was modified affecting the lot or common property` IS FALSE
    `the by-laws were modified` IS TRUE
    `a services contract was entered or varied` IS FALSE
    `a lease or licence over common property was granted or varied` IS FALSE

